{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbc3ab02142cb9897c503b281e0485c5f36ae3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y= \\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"21\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19ac5343ae3e72d247f8e2d0ec7757ae5cca2634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p>\t\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/001cb5569383ad5d1371018329ac35fbbe6cecf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } y&#39; = \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(B) } y&#39; = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(C) } y&#39; = \\dfrac{x\\sqrt{x}}{2} \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(D) } y&#39; = - \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(E) } y&#39; = \\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"626\" height=\"46\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the power rule with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/a/c0a7983635e3b90ea24ba3512c9d1c66714a9ae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/202a99ca473b75555944b1229e277f1a900c6ad5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y&#39; = \\frac{d}{dx} \\left[ x^{1/2} \\right] = \\frac{1}{2} x^{-1/2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}}.\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"52\" /> \n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b>